--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARCHITECTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This page is a pure ORCHESTRATOR (ADR-004). Every web cost-analysis sub-component
already has a native P3 feature view (apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/*); the
page derives the web useCostAnalysisData projection once (CostAnalysisDerivations)
and feeds each shared surface through its own in-memory source. Reused existing
types (no redefinition): ChargingSession, ChargingVehicle, ChargingDateRange,
CostSummaryStats/UnitContext, MonthlyCostSample/Bucket, CostPerKwhSample,
ChargerTypeDatum, SavingsCalculatorData, TimeOfUseHourSample, LifetimeCoreStats/
Metrics/Formatting, EnvironmentalImpactData, CostForecastData, CostForecast,
CostNarrationInput. SI energy(Wh)/power(W) kept canonical; kWh + unit display
conversions happen only at the render boundary via Units / the P3 surfaces (ADR-005).

Web region order reproduced in CostAnalysisSections (every <GlassPanel>/region):
  1 CostSummaryCards   2 MonthlyCostChart + CostPerKwhChart (adaptive pair)
  3 ChargerTypeBreakdown   4 SavingsCalculator   5 MonthlyCostTable
  6 TimeOfUseAnalysis   7 AICostForecastNarration   8 CostForecastSection
  9 ForecastDetails   10 LifetimeSummary + EnvironmentalImpact (adaptive pair)
Adaptive macOS/iPad (regular) vs iPhone (compact) via horizontalSizeClass (ADR-002/006).

